OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is a village holding a
OL,4,Areferendum on leaving the UK?
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a small village set to
OL,7,Fhouse more than 1,000 asylum seekers
OL,8,Fare due to vote in a symbolic
OL,9,Freferendum on whether it should remain
OL,10,Fpart of the UK.
OL,12,FPiddington, a village of about 400
OL,13,Fpeople near Bicester in Oxfordshire,
OL,14,Fdecided in July to hold the vote after
OL,15,Fthe government announced plans to house
OL,16,Fasylum seekers at a nearby Ministry of
OL,17,FDefence (MoD) site.
OL,19,FUnder the proposal, MoD Bicester could
OL,20,Fbe converted into basic accommodation
OL,21,Fto house up to 1,256 male asylum
OL,22,Fseekers.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
