OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is a village holding a
OL,4,Areferendum on leaving the UK?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Home Office said it was "working to
OL,7,Ffairly house asylum seekers across the
OL,8,Fcountry" and that it had saved
OL,9,Ftaxpayers over #1bn on asylum support
OL,10,Fcosts since the election.
